OL,3,AWhere are the most jobs for 18-24
OL,4,Ayear-olds?
OL,5,
OL,6,FIf you're one of the nearly one million
OL,7,Fpeople aged 16-24 not in education,
OL,8,Femployment or training - otherwise
OL,9,Fknown as "Neet" - then you might be
OL,10,Fwondering where to start.
OL,12,FUnder-25s should be guaranteed job
OL,13,Fplacements or training to help them
OL,14,Ffind permanent work, a major review
OL,15,Faimed at cutting the number of Neets
OL,16,Fwill say.
OL,18,FBut how many jobs are there where you
OL,19,Flive and in which sectors are you most
OL,20,Flikely to find an opening?
OL,23,APub: 17-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  BusinessC Nat TVF  Nat News
FL,108,105,200,300,0,100
