OL,3,AWhere are the most jobs for 18-24
OL,4,Ayear-olds?
OL,5,
OL,6,FThere is no official measure of how
OL,7,Fmany vacancies are suitable for young
OL,8,Fpeople, but across the whole economy
OL,9,Fthere were 690,000 jobs available in
OL,10,Fthe August to October period this year,
OL,11,Fwhich is the lowest number since early
OL,12,F2021.
